==English==

===Etymology===
Based on the idea that the player was only there long enough to have a cup of coffee.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|baseball}} When a [[minor league]] player comes up to the [[major league]] team for a short period of time.
#: ''I was up for a '''cup of coffee''' once; those were the best six days of my career.''
# {{lb|en|figurative}} One’s [[personal]] [[preference]].

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|preference}} {{l|en|cup of joe}}, {{l|en|cup of tea}}